API Keys and Configuration

Data fetching

DATABENTO_API_KEY=your_key_here

Webhook authentication (bridge between NT8 and Railway)

WEBHOOK_SECRET=generate_a_random_32byte_hex_string

Optional: Telegram alerts

TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=your_bot_token_from_botfather
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=your_telegram_user_id

Optional: Supabase (deployment phase)

SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_KEY=your_anon_key

Optional: Railway (deployment phase)

RAILWAY_API_TOKEN=your_railway_token

Market data feed (NT8 connection)

Leave blank for demo, fill in when you connect to a prop firm

NT8_CONNECTION_NAME=Demo

Strategy configuration (set during research)

STRATEGY_ENABLED=true
